      "x": 880,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 94,
      "text": "Memory Autopsy (audit trail)\nQuery: \"Why did API deadline push?\"  \u2014 3,247 / 8,192 tokens used\nLOADED: #4421 timeline_shift (rel 0.95)  \u00b7 #4418 risk_flag (rel 0.81)\nFILTERED OUT: #4401 superseded \u00b7 #3990 archived >365d\nPREFERENCES: bullet_points format (conf 0.78)",
